  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "So we're gonna stand on perimeter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "We did have some shots fired right down the street on us",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "While this was going on, so we gotta set up a tight perimeter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "We got the streets blocked off to make sure we don't have any drivebys on us",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Other than that, the operation went fairly well",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Hell no, this shit is crazy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Where is it they're coming from?",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I don't believe that shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABABCDEF",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABABCDED"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Who told you that? Rolled through, brrat!",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Old to the new knows who holds the hat",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Custom tailored fitted, head stayed same size",
          "rhyme": "Ez",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Big since first born, well spitted game wise",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Same guy, same disguise",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Sick aim eye stare at thick dame thighs, click claim prize",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And the lucky contestant was sent",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "A whole year's supply of buckets of yucky excrement",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Digital format, provide the ROM",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Ride calm, flow was like a roadside bomb (Woo)",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Flipped the Humvee, impact was limb-numbing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Cameraman wig back, gunner screaming, \"Incoming!\"",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "RPG, rhyme propelled grenade",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Time to yell, scramble for cover in the shade",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Bright as the midday sun, then it fade",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Darkness come quick, some run and get sprayed",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Rot dead, hot lead, it's rainin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Left 'em with their brains kicked in with their trainin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Dragged the remains into the open by the bootstraps",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Dog tag attached to explosive human booby traps",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Where's air support? Ears ringin', mortars whistlin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Bloodshot vision, afterthought: abort mission",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Too little too late, as the last man gush",
          "rhyme": "9S",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Took no prisoners mush, rap ambush",
          "rhyme": "uS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCCCDDEFGGHHHIJJKKJFLM",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABCCCDDEFCCAAAGHHAAHFIJ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "outro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Murdalizing sucker emcees!",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "A",
      "rhyme_vowel": "A"
    }
  ]
